{
  "uid": "tokoku-overview",
  "title": "TokoKu: Live Demo",
  "description": "Main demo dashboard: k6 load, application RED metrics, resources, and queues.",
  "tags": [
    "tokoku"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "arch",
        "label": "Architecture",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "monolith,microservices",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": "monolith|microservices",
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "All",
            "value": "$__all",
            "selected": true
          },
          {
            "text": "monolith",
            "value": "monolith",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "microservices",
            "value": "microservices",
            "selected": false
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Goal:** correlate *load* (k6) with *performance* (latency, errors) and *resources* (CPU, memory) on the same time axis. Hover over one panel and the time cursor moves on every other panel too.\n\nPhases as load grows: **Linear** (latency flat) → **Saturation** (latency creeps up, resources near their limit) → **Breaking** (latency spikes, errors rise) → **Collapse** (mass timeouts).  See also the *Containers (cAdvisor)* dashboard for CPU vs limit and throttling."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "① Load from k6 (client side)",
      "id": 2,
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Active virtual users",
      "description": "Number of k6 virtual users currently running",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (arch) (k6_vus{arch=~\"$arch\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{arch}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max",
            "mean"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
